This project is a derivative work of PSG-JEPA
    https://github.com/Haodong-Yan/PSG-JEPA
    Yan et al., "Is Forward Prediction Enough? Physical State Grounding for JEPA World Models",
    arXiv:2608.06799 (2026)

psgjepa1d/grounding.py is a close port of psgjepa/grounding.py from that repository, adapted from
a robot-arm state space to a 1-D longitudinal car state space. Its structure, the per-horizon
weighting of the transition loss, and the optional velocity head follow the original.

